{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"503124","name":"告示【梅洛彼得堡】","desc":"告示【梅洛彼得堡】","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/5d8fa6cf39f916b29958c82c93a412c1_3802090208086646920.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"告示【梅洛彼得堡】","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"截图\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/472c9ba698f66cd2e3f7b28b9c48716c_1311568721861235782.png\"},{\"tab_name\":\"位置\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/32962d4dc49b84bf56ea46b7dd3ebcd7_9038565119818051514.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"5712","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"交互文本","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"i6zeglgngxT1730224004333\",\"child_ids\":{\"i6zeglgngxT1730224004333\":[]},\"contents\":{\"i6zeglgngxT1730224004333\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003ch1 class=\\\"custom-heading-cls\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e告示\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003e即日起，停止在晶簇矿坑道的各项作业，并封锁连通路。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e若因公需要开启连通路，应在技术专家监督下操作传动机阀，以免发生意外。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e传动机阀安全操作指南\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e一、可通过传动机阀管理各间旋转及连通路启闭。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e二、传动机阀由「核心齿轮传动器」（不可拆卸）及\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 151, 225)\\\"\u003e「齿轮传动器」（可拆卸）\u003c/span\u003e两部分控制。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e三、不可拆卸的「核心齿轮传动器」控制中央房间，可拆卸的「齿轮传动器」控制各方向连通路。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e四、操作时需留意，\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 151, 225)\\\"\u003e在「核心齿轮传动器」与「齿轮传动器」指示方向相对时终止运行，「核心齿轮传动器」指示的连通路将会开启\u003c/span\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e五、四个「齿轮传动器」均未安装的情况下，传动机阀将会自动终止运行。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e各方向连通路开启状态如下所示：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 151, 225)\\\"\u003e一号备品仓库方向\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/98669a2241b59be33bfb9e250fcd52cd_3801743715141125044.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"769\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 769px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/98669a2241b59be33bfb9e250fcd52cd_3801743715141125044.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 769px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 151, 225)\\\"\u003e晶簇矿坑道方向\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/e88400de3f373d7972d8c2c58bdd9e94_2080678026020498710.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"765\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 765px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/e88400de3f373d7972d8c2c58bdd9e94_2080678026020498710.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 765px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 151, 225)\\\"\u003e储能装置仓库方向\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/4a36f1f13e3adf048ce8cd3c6b542229_8749333123427339364.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"765\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 765px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/4a36f1f13e3adf048ce8cd3c6b542229_8749333123427339364.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 765px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 151, 225)\\\"\u003e二号备品仓库方向\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/1a2cfdb7bcfec2b8efde714b274d28a7_8502763422407874458.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"769\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 769px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/30/317305234/1a2cfdb7bcfec2b8efde714b274d28a7_8502763422407874458.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 769px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e另，晶簇矿坑道已部署全新闭锁装置，且为了避免误操作，暂时移除了研察终端的配套储能装置。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e禁止无关人员在未授权的情况下前往，因违反规定造成的一切后果将由行为主体自行承担。 \u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"5713","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"相关任务","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"coll